One line per project. This and the seed values file are the only two things you commit to onboard a project.

6.2 charts/workspace-configmap/templates/configmap.yaml

apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: dagster-workspace      # name is load-bearing — referenced by platform
data:
  workspace.yaml: |
    load_from:
    {{- range .Values.locations }}
