8. ArgoCD ApplicationSets

8.1 AppSet #1 — platform (+ workspace CM), generator over envs

apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: ApplicationSet
metadata:
  name: dagster-platform
  namespace: argocd
spec:
  goTemplate: true
  generators:
    - list:
        elements:
          - env: dev
            cluster: https://kubernetes.default.svc
          - env: prod
            cluster: https://kubernetes.default.svc
  template:
    metadata:
      name: "dagster-platform-{{ .env }}"
    spec:
      project: dagster
      sources:
        - repoURL: https://github.com/srca/aiops-dagster
          targetRevision: main
          path: charts/platform
          helm:
            valueFiles: ["values/values-{{ .env }}.yaml"]
        - repoURL: https://github.com/srca/aiops-dagster
          targetRevision: main
          path: charts/workspace-configmap
          helm:
            valueFiles: ["values-{{ .env }}.yaml"]
      destination:
        server: "{{ .cluster }}"
        namespace: "dagster-{{ .env }}"
      syncPolicy:
        automated: { prune: true, selfHeal: true }
        syncOptions: [CreateNamespace=true]


8.2 AppSet #2 — code locations, git file generator (the seed)

apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: ApplicationSet
metadata:
  name: dagster-locations-prod
  namespace: argocd
spec:
  goTemplate: true
  generators:
    - git:
        repoURL: https://github.com/srca/aiops-dagster
        revision: main
        files:
          - path: "projects/*/deploy/values-prod.yaml"
  template:
    metadata:
      # locationName comes straight from the seed file's content
      name: "dg-loc-{{ .locationName }}-prod"
    spec:
      project: dagster
      source:
        repoURL: https://github.com/srca/aiops-dagster
        targetRevision: main
        path: charts/code-location
        helm:
          valueFiles: ["../../{{ .path.path }}/values-prod.yaml"]
      destination:
        server: https://kubernetes.default.svc
        namespace: dagster-prod
      syncPolicy:
        automated: { prune: true, selfHeal: true }


Duplicate once as dagster-locations-dev with values-dev.yaml and dagster-dev. The git file generator flattens the seed file's fields into template params — that's why {{ .locationName }} works and why the seed file needs no registration anywhere else.
