Appendix A — Env var naming convention

<PROJECT>_<PURPOSE> for project-scoped (CHURN_SRC_ENDPOINT), bare names for platform-wide (AWS_REGION, DAGSTER_IO_BUCKET). Secrets always flow via ExternalSecret, never in env: maps or .env committed files. .env is gitignored; .env.example is committed with empty/dummy values and is the parity contract.

Appendix B — What you commit for common actions
Action	Files touched
New project	project dir + 2 seed values + 1 workspace line + kargo scaffold
Config change (non-secret)	1 seed values file
Secret rotation	Parameter Store only (ESO refreshes ≤1h)
Deploy new code to dev	nothing — CI + Kargo automatic
Promote to prod	zero files — Kargo promote (gated)
Scale run resources	runK8sConfig in 1 seed file
Dagster upgrade	1 PR: shared pin + Chart.yaml + lock-all
